  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of results on the present municipal twinning cooperation between Sweden and Bosnia, and to present an analysis and conclusions as to how it has contributed to the development of the Bosnian municipalities and how a possible further step in this cooperation could best be developed. Sida-support: SEK 185 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Resultatanalys av det f&#xf6;rdjupade v&#xe4;nortssamarbetet i Bosnien- Hercegovina. 1997-1999. Insatsen syftar till att utv&#xe4;rdera, insamla feed back fr&#xe5;n svenska och bosniska kommuner samt att f&#xf6;resl&#xe5; f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar eller andra samarbetsformer f&#xf6;r kommunal utveckling i Bosnien.Sida-st&#xf6;d:SEK 185 000. Svensk Part &#xe4;r Svenska Kommunf&#xf6;rbundet</narrative>
  </description>
